# Time Conversion (12-hour to 24-hour)

## Problem

Given a time in 12-hour AM/PM format, convert it to 24-hour (military) time.

---

## Notes

- 12:00:00AM -> 00:00:00
- 12:00:00PM -> 12:00:00

---

## Examples

| Input        | Output     |
|-------------|------------|
| 12:01:00PM  | 12:01:00  |
| 12:01:00AM  | 00:01:00  |
| 07:05:45PM  | 19:05:45  |

---

## Function Description

Function Name: timeConversion

Parameters:
- s -> A string representing time in 12-hour format (hh:mm:ssAM or hh:mm:ssPM)

Returns:
- A string representing time in 24-hour format (HH:mm:ss)

---

## Input Format

A single string s that represents time in 12-hour format:


hh:mm:ssAM
hh:mm:ssPM


---

## Constraints

All input times are valid.

---

## Sample Input 0


07:05:45PM


## Sample Output 0


19:05:45
